>//@brief Barker proposal: gradient-informed and robust to a mistuned step size
#^^ source.lapkernel comment.line.double-slash.documentation.lapkernel
#  ^^^^^^ source.lapkernel comment.line.double-slash.documentation.lapkernel keyword.other.doctag.lapkernel
#        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.lapkernel comment.line.double-slash.documentation.lapkernel
